instructions:
In package.json, at the text `  "scripts": {
    "test": "node --test"
  }`: Add two sibling keys after the "scripts" object, keeping valid JSON: a `"bin": { "todo": "src/bin/todo.js" }` entry pointing at the entry point, and a `"files": ["src/", "README.md"]` array so the throwaway todo store is not published. Leave the existing "name", "type" and "scripts" untouched.
